<%- include('partials/header') %>
<section class="section"><div class="narrow">
  <h1 style="font-size:34px">Privacy notice</h1>
  <p class="muted">Last updated 25 November 2026. Draft for legal review.</p>
  <p>HollaTap is operated by <%= config.company %> ("we"). This notice explains what personal data we collect, why, and your rights under the Nigeria Data Protection Act 2023.</p>
  <h2 style="font-size:22px">Instant Card</h2>
  <p>Instant Card runs entirely in your browser. The details, logo and PDF you use are processed on your device and are never sent to us. We do not store them.</p>
  <h2 style="font-size:22px">Accounts and cards</h2>
  <p>If you create an account, we store your email address, the details you put on your cards, your logo (converted to a small image), your industry if you choose one, and basic usage counts (card views and saves, without visitors' IP addresses). We use them only to run HollaTap: to show your card, sign you in, and provide the features of your plan.</p>
  <h2 style="font-size:22px">Contacts shared with you</h2>
  <p>When a visitor uses "Share my details" on a card, they consent to send their details to that card's owner. We store them so the owner can see them, and email the owner a copy. Owners can delete them at any time.</p>
  <h2 style="font-size:22px">Payments</h2>
  <p>Payments are processed by Paystack. We never see or store your card details. We keep payment records as required by law.</p>
  <h2 style="font-size:22px">Marketing</h2>
  <p>We send marketing emails only if you tick the box to agree. You can unsubscribe at any time.</p>
  <h2 style="font-size:22px">Teams</h2>
  <p>For company cards, your employer decides what appears on your card and can switch it off. We process that data on your employer's behalf.</p>
  <h2 style="font-size:22px">Where data is stored</h2>
  <p>Our servers are provided by reputable cloud providers that may be outside Nigeria. We use contractual safeguards for these transfers as the law requires.</p>
  <h2 style="font-size:22px">How long we keep data</h2>
  <p>Until you delete it. Accounts unused for 12 months are deleted after a 30-day email warning, unless on a paid plan.</p>
  <h2 style="font-size:22px">Your rights</h2>
  <p>You can access, correct or delete your data at any time from your account. "Delete my data" removes your account, cards, logos and shared contacts permanently. For any other request, or to complain, email <a href="mailto:<%= config.supportEmail %>"><%= config.supportEmail %></a>. You may also complain to the Nigeria Data Protection Commission.</p>
  <h2 style="font-size:22px">Security</h2>
  <p>We use encrypted connections, limit staff access, and record security incidents. We will notify you and the regulator of any breach as the law requires.</p>
</div></section>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
